<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CADisableMinimumFrameDurationOnPhone</key>
	<true/>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_PACKAGE_TYPE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>1.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleSignature</key>
	<string>????</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>1</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>LSMinimumSystemVersion</key>
	<string>12.0</string>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSAllowsArbitraryLoads</key>
		<false/>
		<key>NSAllowsLocalNetworking</key>
		<true/>
	</dict>
	<key>NSCalendarsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>일정에서 목적과 준비물을 파악하고, 앱에서 추가한 일정을 캘린더에 넣기 위해 캘린더 접근 권한이 필요해요.</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>일정에서 목적과 준비물을 파악하고, 앱에서 추가한 일정을 캘린더에 넣기 위해 캘린더 접근 권한이 필요해요.</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>앱을 닫아 둬도 등록한 집을 벗어나는 순간을 확인해 안 챙긴 물건을 알려드리기 위해 위치 권한이 필요해요. 위치는 기기 안에서만 쓰여요.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>현재 위치의 날씨를 확인하고 집 Wi-Fi를 등록해 외출을 감지하기 위해 위치 권한이 필요해요.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>체크리스트 항목을 음성으로 추가하려면 마이크 접근이 필요해요.</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>말한 내용을 텍스트로 변환해 체크리스트에 추가하려면 음성 인식 접근이 필요해요.</string>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>fetch</string>
		<string>processing</string>
	</array>
	<key>BGTaskSchedulerPermittedIdentifiers</key>
	<array>
		<string>com.transistorsoft.fetch</string>
		<string>com.transistorsoft.ahmatda-departure-check</string>
		<string>com.transistorsoft.ahmatda-departure-recheck</string>
	</array>
	<key>UILaunchStoryboardName</key>
	<string>SplashScreen</string>
	<key>UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities</key>
	<array>
		<string>arm64</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIStatusBarStyle</key>
	<string>UIStatusBarStyleDefault</string>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>LSApplicationQueriesSchemes</key>
	<array>
		<string>nmap</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIViewControllerBasedStatusBarAppearance</key>
	<false/>
</dict>
</plist>
